  "goodToKnow": "Pragmatisch means pragmatic, focused on what works: eine pragmatische Lösung, pragmatisch handeln. Former chancellor Helmut Schmidt was famous for his pragmatism and the quip that anyone with visions should see a doctor. Der Pragmatismus is pragmatism, der Pragmatiker a pragmatist. In linguistics, die Pragmatik is the study of language in use."
